## SQ-HR-01 | raspberry member loads
@group A
@commands Boot; grep `latest.log` for `hearthandharvest`, `raspberr`, `Error occurred while handling event`
@pass member `hearthandharvest` loads; no missing model / texture for `hearthandharvest:raspberry_bush`; no error in `hearthandharvest/*.js`; recipe `creativedelight:...raspberry_pips_from_raspberry` loaded; watering can still registers
@fails two registrations under one namespace clash; NCH key missing
@from batches/r1101/p1_server.qb passed
@reviewed 2026-11-16
bootreject (?i)(missing|unknown).*(raspberry)
bootreject hearthandharvest/.*\.js.*(Error|error)
# id hearthandharvest:raspberry since r1118 (judge-8, 2026-11-18): 'raspberries' was never registered
> cdevtest item hearthandharvest:raspberry_pips
> cdevtest item hearthandharvest:raspberry
> cdevtest makes hearthandharvest:raspberry_pips
reject Unknown item
expect raspberry_pips_from_raspberry
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0

## SQ-HR-02 | pips plant on dirt, not sand; grow to age 3
@group A
@commands `/setblock ~ ~-1 ~ minecraft:dirt`, bot uses `hearthandharvest:raspberry_pips` on it; also on sand; `/gamerule randomTickSpeed 300`, wait; `/execute if block ~ ~ ~ hearthandharvest:raspberry_bush[age=3]`
@pass placed on dirt, refused on sand; reaches age 3
@fails soil rule
@from batches/r1101/p1_server.qb passed
# self-contained since r1118 (rowfix-1, 2026-11-18): bot spawn from r1101 p1_server / r1031 a1_world bot row
> execute unless entity qa run pbot spawn qa 0 -60 0 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> setblock 20 -61 -10 minecraft:dirt
> setblock 22 -61 -10 minecraft:sand
> tp qa 21 -60 -12
> pbot hold qa hearthandharvest:raspberry_pips
> pbot use qa 20 -61 -10 up
> pbot hold qa hearthandharvest:raspberry_pips
> pbot use qa 22 -61 -10 up
> execute if block 20 -60 -10 hearthandharvest:raspberry_bush
> execute if block 22 -60 -10 minecraft:air
count Test passed >= 2
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 300
sleep 45
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> execute if block 20 -60 -10 hearthandharvest:raspberry_bush[age=3]
count Test passed >= 3

