@group A
@commands `/tag` check via `/kubejs` or `/dumptags`: `forge:fruits/raspberries`, `forge:berries`, `minecraft:fox_food`, `forge:seeds/raspberry`, `forge:seeds`; `/summon fox` next to an age 3 bush, wait 60 s
@pass tags hold the items; the fox empties the bush to age 1 and holds a raspberry
@fails tags.js not run (member switch); fox goal not added
@from batches/r1101/p1_server.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
