@group B
@commands New world, seed 8675309; `/cdevtest tag biome creativedelight:wild_crops/raspberry`; `/locate biome minecraft:forest`, fly there; `/cdevtest count` and `ages` over a 57x76x57 box (under the 262144-block cap)
@pass tag lists 26 biomes; ripe raspberry bush patches in forest / plains
@fails `requires` skipped the rule; feature json invalid in 1.19.2
@from batches/r1101/w2_worldgen.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-18
# r1118 judge-15 (2026-11-18): bootexpect dropped (the [wild-crops] log names no rules, r1101), own bot spawn, box under the cap
